    "name": "Parties and Agreement",
    "text": "This Agreement (“Agreement”) sets forth the terms and conditions of the agreement between Xenophon Strategles, Inc. (“Xenophon”) and Jernigan, Copeland & Anderson, PLLC (\"The Client”), headquartered In Ridgeland, Mississippi."
