  },
  {
    "id": "c011",
    "name": "1.1 Scope of Services — Editorial outreach",
    "text": "Editorial Outreach. Undertake a program to reach out to editorlal boards; to write and place op-ed columns In key publications and assist with editorial outreach specifically within Misslssippl."
