    "text": "6 Soclal Media, Build a soclal media platform on one or more platforms, develop content and build a relevant audience with Interest In the Issues."
  },
  {
    "id": "c014",
    "name": "1.1 Scope of Services — Monitoring and recommendations",
    "text": "Monltoring and Rapid Response, Perform perlodic monitoring on the project's Issues and make rapid response recommendations to the cllent."
  },
