  {
    "id": "c021",
    "name": "3.1 Staffing",
    "text": "rticle 3 Staffin 3,1 Staffing. Staff for this scope of work will Include but is not limited to the following Xenophon personnel: David A. Fuscus, President Mark Hazlin, Senlor Vice President Jennifer June, Vice President Tarnmy Lindenberg, Senlor Counselor Amanda Reid, Senlor Assoclate Walker Hamblin, Assoclate"
  },
  {
    "id": "c022",
    "name": "3.2 Substitution — Similarly qualified staff",
    "text": "3,2 Substitution, The Client understands and agrees that Xenophon may substitute another similarly quallfled staff member to perform the Services,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c023",
    "name": "3.2 Substitution — Staff augmentation",
    "text": "The Cllent also understands and agrees that Xenophon may, from time to tlme and at Its discretion, augment the above-referenced staff, as needed, to perform the agreed-upon Services."
  },
  {
    "id": "c024",
    "name": "3.3 Offers of Employment — Non-solicitation",
    "text": "3,3 Offers of Employment. Both Partles agree not to make offers of employment to any of the other Party’s employees during or for a perlad of one year following the conclusion of this Agreement."
  },
  {
    "id": "c025",
    "name": "3.3 Offers of Employment — Covered individuals",
    "text": "This provision Includes any Individuals then-currently employed by the applicable Party during the term of the Agreement elther directly or through a third party."
  },
  {
    "id": "c026",
    "name": "3.3 Offers of Employment — Damages",
    "text": "The Partles agree that violation of this provision will result in damages equal to one year of the employee's gross salary,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c027",
    "name": "Section 4.1 — Fees",
    "text": "4,1 Fees, Based on the above scope of work, Xenophon will be compensated with a monthly retainer of $30,000 plus expenses, Xenophon will track all hours and supply full detail to the cliant along with them monthly Involces. All professlonal fees are subject to a possible calendar year price Increase not to exceed 5%,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c028",
    "name": "4.2 Qut-of-Pocket Expenses",
    "text": "4.2, Qut-of-Pocket Expenses, The Cllent agrees and understands that Xenophon is entitled to relmbursement for Out-of-Pocket Expenses (“Expenses”) Incurred routinely In conducting Its work on the Client's behalf,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c029",
    "name": "4.2(a) Six-percent expense fee",
    "text": "(a) The Client agrees to pay Xenophon a fee of six percent (6%) of the professional fees contained In the Cllent’s monthly Invoice for the following categories of expenses: Database access/search fees; long distance phone and facsimile charges; cllent-related cell phone charges; local transportation charges and reference materials and In-house photocopying."
  },
  {
    "id": "c030",
    "name": "4.2(b) Meals and non-local travel",
    "text": "(b) The Client also agrees to reimburse Xenophon, at cost, for expenses Incurred for meals and non-local travel (I.¢,, transportation, lodging, meals and related expenses) authorized by the Cllent."
  },
  {
    "id": "c031",
    "name": "4.2(c) Third-party expense reimbursement",
    "text": "(c) The Client agrees and understands that Xenophon Is entitled to relmbursement for Third-party Expenses and agrees to pay Xenophon the cost of Third-party Expenses upon recelpt,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c032",
    "name": "4.2(c) Third-party expenses defined",
    "text": "Third-party Expenses shall include, without limitation, the cost of conference calls, subscriptions to specialty publications, external supplier services for media distribution, graphic design, website construction, advertlsing placement, video production, printed materials, third-party spokesperson fees, meeting factlltles and related food, beverage, and audio visual equipment and other vendor and/or subcontractor charges, or others,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c033",
    "name": "4.2(c) Prior approval",
    "text": "Xenophon agrees and understands that all Third-party Expenses of $1,000 or more must receive priot approval from the Client,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c034",
    "name": "4.2(c) Markup and travel costs",
    "text": "All third party expenses will be billed along with an Industry standard mark up of 17,65%, excluding travel related expenses which shall be billed at cost."
  },
  {
    "id": "c035",
    "name": "Section 5.1 — Monthly Invoices",
    "text": "5,1 Monthly Invoices. Xenophon shall provide the client with monthly invoices detalllng Its fees and expenses."
  },
  {
    "id": "c036",
    "name": "Section 5.1(a) — Services Invoices",
    "text": "(a) For Services, the Client will be Invoiced for Services on a monthly basis, along with the six percent professlonal fee outlined In section 4.2 (a) (“Out-of-Pocket Expenses”), Involces will be sent on or about the 1° of each month and payment is due upon recelpt, The first Involce of this contract will be delivered on or about November 1, 2014 for work performed In October, 2014. A detalled summary of billable time will be provided to the cllent the following month, after It Is Incurred."
  },
  {
    "id": "c037",
    "name": "5.1(b) Travel and third-party invoices",
    "text": "(b) For Travel and Third-party expenses, the Client will be Involced after costs are Incurred,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c038",
    "name": "5.1(b) Payment due",
    "text": "Payment Is due upon receipt."
  },
  {
    "id": "c039",
    "name": "5.1(b) First expense invoice",
    "text": "The first Expense Invoice will be dellvered on or about December 1, 2014,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c040",
    "name": "5.2 Late Payments — Interest",
    "text": "5,2 Late Payments, Xenophon reserves the right to Impose an interest charge equal to Its own borrowing rate for any Involce payment outstanding more than 30 days."
  },
  {
    "id": "c041",
    "name": "5.2 Late Payments — Work stoppage",
    "text": "Xenophon may also stop work on Clent accounts that are overdue."
  },
  {
    "id": "c042",
    "name": "5.2 Late Payments — No liability for suspension",
    "text": "In the avent Xenophon must suspend work because of the Cilent’s fallure to pay Its Monthly Invoices In a tlmely fashion, Xenophon shall have no llabllity to the Cllent for delay or damage caused because of such suspension of work."
  },
  {
    "id": "c043",
    "name": "Section 6.1 — Modification or Stopping of Work",
    "text": "6.1 Modification or Stopping of Work, The Client shall have the right to modify or stop any schedules or work {In progress under this agreement; and In such event, Xenophon shall Immediately take proper steps to carry out such Instructions. However, In any such case, Client, agrees (|) to assume Xenophon’s liability for commitments made to thirdparty vendors In respect of such work; (Il) to pay Xenophon In accordance with the terms and provisions of thls Agreement and (Ifl) to Indemnify Xenophon for all claims and actlonis by third partles for damages In corisequence of Xenophon’s carrying out the Client's instructions,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c044",
    "name": "7.1 General Indemnification",
    "text": "Article 7 ~- General Provisions 7.1 General Indemnification. The Client will Indemnity Xenophon against any loss or expense which Xenophon may Incur as the result of any clalm, sult or proceeding made or brought against Xenophon, or In which Xenophon Is asked to participate, based upon Information provided or approved by the Cllent prior to Its dissemination, production or publication, as well as any clalm or sult brought agalnst Xenophon as a result of its following the Instructlons of the Client, except for any loss or expense arising out of, elther directly or Indirectly, Xenophon’s negligent acts or omissions."
  },
  {
    "id": "c045",
    "name": "7.1 General Indemnification — Survival",
    "text": "The obligations of this paragraph will survive the expiration of thls Agreement."
  },
  {
    "id": "c046",
    "name": "7.2 Confidentiality",
    "text": "7.2 Confidentiality, Xenophon shall use Its best efforts to safeguard the confidentiality of all proprietary and other confidential {information and materlals provided by the Cllent and to avold any dissernination of any such Information or materlals without the Client's explicit prior approval."
  },
  {
    "id": "c047",
    "name": "7.3 Performance of Subcontractors and Suppliers",
    "text": "7,3. Performance of Subcontractors and Suppliers, Xenophon will endeavor, to the best of Its ability, to guard agalnst any loss to the Cllant through the fallure of subcontractors and suppllers to execute properly thelr commitments, but Xenophon shall not be held responsible for any such fallure on the part of such subcontractors or suppllers."
  },
  {
    "id": "c048",
    "name": "7.4 Governing Law",
    "text": "7,4 Governing Law and Attorney’s Fees. This Agreement shall be governed by and construed In accordance with the laws of the District of Columbla, but excluding the conflict of laws rules thereof."
  },
  {
    "id": "c049",
    "name": "7.4 Attorney’s Fees",
    "text": "In any dispute between the parties concerning any alleged breach of this Agreement, the prevailing party shall be entitled to receive its reasonable attorney's fees and expenses,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c050",
    "name": "7.5 Assignment",
    "text": "7.5 Assignment. Nelther Party may assign any of Its rights or delegate any of Its dutles or obligations under thls Agreement without the express written consent of the other Party,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c051",
    "name": "7.6 Partlal Invalldity",
    "text": "7.6 Partlal Invalldity. In the event that any provision of this Agreement shall be construed to be Illegal or Invalld for any reason, sald legality or invalidity shall not affect the remaining provisions hereof, but such illegal or Invalid provision shall be fully severable and this Agreement shall be construed and enforced as If such Illegal and Invalid provision had never been Included hereln,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c052",
    "name": "7.7 Ownership — Deliverables",
    "text": "7.7 Ownership. Xenophon acknowledges and agrees that any materlals developed or created on behalf of the Client or a related entity In connection with the Services (a \"Dellverable\") are belng created and developed as a Work Made for Hire as defined by U.S. copyright laws and are owned by the Cllent."
  },
  {
    "id": "c053",
    "name": "7.7 Ownership — Template and exemplar use",
    "text": "However, Xenophon may make routine use of the final work product developed pursuant to this Agreement as templates or exemplars, provided that any materlals provided to third parties that are based upon such final work product cannot be Identifled as relating to the Client."
  },
  {
    "id": "c054",
    "name": "7.7 Ownership — Methodologies and non-final work",
    "text": "Xenophon will own copyright, title, and Interest In the methodologies used by Xenophon to develop the final work product produced pursuant to thls contract, as well as any drafts or other non-final work product,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c055",
    "name": "7.7 Ownership — Publication restriction",
    "text": "Xenophon agrees not to publish any drafts or other non-final work product if such publication can be Identifled as relating to the Client."
  },
  {
    "id": "c056",
    "name": "7.8 Entira Agreement",
    "text": "7.8 Entira Agreement. This Agreement constitutes the entire agreement between the Partlas with respect to the subject matter hereof, and supersedes any prior discussions, negotiations, or agreements with respact to the subject matter hereof,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c057",
    "name": "7.8 Written amendments",
    "text": "It may be changed only by a written agreement signed by the Parties,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c058",
    "name": "7.9 Notice",
    "text": "7,9 Notice, Alf notices hereunder shall be In writing and shall be deemed dellvered Upon personal delivery, delivery by Federal Express or another national recognized express delivery service, recelpt requested, or three (3) days after deposit In the U.S, mall, first class postage prepaid, certified, return recelpt requested, addressed as follows or as Indicated by written notice of change of address: Client: Jernigan, Copaland & Anderson, PLLC 587 Highland Colony Parkway Ridgeland, MS 39158-2598 Xenophon: Xenophon Strategles, Inc, Attn: Contract AdminIstration 1901 LST NW - Sulte 300 Washington, DC 20036"
