  {"clause_id": "c003", "issues": [
    {"issue": "The deliverables are introduced by \"Including:\", leaving open whether the enumerated communications tools are exhaustive or merely illustrative of a larger duty. Terms such as \"proof points\" and \"weakness inoculation\" have no fixed meaning.", "type": 1, "prob": 0.19},
    {"issue": null, "type": 2, "prob": 0.06}
  ]},
  {"clause_id": "c004", "issues": [
    {"issue": "\"[A]ll branding, digital and other needed collateral materials\" pairs a general catch-all with two specifics, leaving the reach of \"other needed\" materials uncertain. Who decides what is \"needed\" is not stated.", "type": 1, "prob": 0.27},
    {"issue": null, "type": 2, "prob": 0.07}
  ]},
  {"clause_id": "c005", "issues": [
    {"issue": "\"[A]s needed such as voter issue mapping or focus groups\" leaves the reach of the research obligation to be inferred from two examples. Whether Xenophon merely recommends or must procure the research is also unclear.", "type": 1, "prob": 0.19},
    {"issue": null, "type": 2, "prob": 0.07}
